 "document": {
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "start",
    "type": "builtin:start",
    "position": {
     "x": 100,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "inputs_schema": {
      "file_path": {
       "type": "file",
       "required": true,
       "description": "输入文档路径",
       "file_types": [
        ".docx",
        ".pdf",
        ".txt",
        ".md"
       ]
      },
      "output_format": {
       "type": "select",
       "options": [
        "DOCX",
        "PDF",
        "PPTX",
        "Markdown",
        "HTML"
       ],
       "default": "PDF",
       "description": "输出格式"
      },
      "analysis_type": {
       "type": "select",
       "options": [
        "摘要",
        "关键词提取",
        "结构分析",
        "情感分析",
        "翻译"
       ],
       "default": "摘要",
       "description": "分析类型"
      }
     }
    },
    "label": "开始",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   },
   {
    "id": "read_doc",
    "type": "builtin:doc-read",
    "position": {
     "x": 400,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "file_path": "{{file_path}}",
     "format": "auto"
    },
    "label": "读取文档",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   },
   {
    "id": "analyze",
    "type": "builtin:llm",
    "position": {
     "x": 700,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "prompt": "分析以下文档内容：\n\n{{read_doc.output}}\n\n分析类型：{{analysis_type}}\n\n要求：\n1. 提供详细分析结果\n2. 保持原文关键信息\n3. 结构化输出\n4. 适合进一步处理\n\n输出格式：JSON",
     "temperature": 0.3,
     "max_tokens": 2000
    },
    "label": "内容分析",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   },
   {
    "id": "format",
    "type": "builtin:llm",
    "position": {
     "x": 1000,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "prompt": "根据分析结果格式化文档：\n\n分析结果：{{analyze.output}}\n原始内容：{{read_doc.output}}\n输出格式：{{output_format}}\n\n要求：\n1. 保持分析结果的完整性\n2. 适合目标格式\n3. 包含必要的元数据\n4. 格式规范\n\n输出格式化后的内容：",
     "temperature": 0.2,
     "max_tokens": 3000
    },
    "label": "文档格式化",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   },
   {
    "id": "save",
    "type": "builtin:doc-write",
    "position": {
     "x": 1300,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "content": "{{format.output}}",
     "format": "{{output_format}}",
     "template": "default"
    },
    "label": "保存文档",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   },
   {
    "id": "end",
    "type": "builtin:end",
    "position": {
     "x": 1600,
     "y": 100
    },
    "config": {
     "output_mapping": {
      "analysis": "{{analyze.output}}",
      "formatted_content": "{{format.output}}",
      "output_path": "{{save.output.path}}",
      "format": "{{output_format}}"
     }
    },
    "label": "结束",
    "enabled": true,
    "metadata": {},
    "mock_output": null
   }
